  ($q$prod-016$q$, $q$GANESHA TEE$q$, $q$ganesha-tee$q$, $q$Lord Ganesha seated before a red sun, with Om and Vakratunda in brush-stroke Devanagari. Oversized 240 GSM French Terry cotton, bio + silicone washed, DTF back print.$q$, $q$The remover of obstacles, drawn in ink and red. For every new start.$q$, NULL, 699, 999, NULL, $q$mythology$q$, ARRAY[$q$ganesha$q$, $q$vakratunda$q$, $q$om$q$, $q$mythology$q$, $q$oversized$q$, $q$240gsm$q$]::TEXT[], $q$240 GSM FRENCH TERRY // BIO + SILICONE WASH$q$, 240, $q$Oversized Drop-Shoulder$q$, $q$240 GSM French Terry Cotton, Bio + Silicone Washed$q$, $q$BRVD-GNS-04$q$, true, true, false, $q$DESIGN 04$q$, $q$NEW DROP$q$, $q${"front":"/images/products/ganesha/preview.webp"}$q$::jsonb, $q$[{"color":"Black","size":"S","stock":10},{"color":"Black","size":"M","stock":10},{"color":"Black","size":"L","stock":10},{"color":"Black","size":"XL","stock":10},{"color":"Black","size":"XXL","stock":10}]$q$::jsonb, $q$PUBLISHED$q$),
  ($q$prod-015$q$, $q$BORN TO RISE TEE$q$, $q$born-to-rise-tee$q$, $q$A black eagle with blazing red wings under the words Born to Rise, printed large across the back, with a small BRAVADIAN mark on the front left chest. Oversized 240 GSM French Terry cotton, bio + silicone washed, DTF print.$q$, $q$For the days you start again. An eagle rises against the wind, not away from it.$q$, NULL, 699, 999, NULL, $q$street-culture$q$, ARRAY[$q$eagle$q$, $q$born to rise$q$, $q$street culture$q$, $q$oversized$q$, $q$240gsm$q$]::TEXT[], $q$240 GSM FRENCH TERRY // BIO + SILICONE WASH$q$, 240, $q$Oversized Drop-Shoulder$q$, $q$240 GSM French Terry Cotton, Bio + Silicone Washed$q$, $q$BRVD-BTR-03$q$, true, true, false, $q$DESIGN 03$q$, $q$NEW DROP$q$, $q${"front":"/images/products/born-to-rise/black-back.webp","closeup":"/images/products/born-to-rise/black-closeup.webp","lifestyle":"/images/products/born-to-rise/black-model.webp","lifestyle2":"/images/products/born-to-rise/white-model.webp","colors":{"Black":{"front":"/images/products/born-to-rise/black-back.webp","model":"/images/products/born-to-rise/black-model.webp","closeup":"/images/products/born-to-rise/black-closeup.webp"},"White":{"front":"/images/products/born-to-rise/white-back.webp","model":"/images/products/born-to-rise/white-model.webp","closeup":"/images/products/born-to-rise/white-closeup.webp"}}}$q$::jsonb, $q$[{"color":"Black","size":"S","stock":10},{"color":"Black","size":"M","stock":10},{"color":"Black","size":"L","stock":10},{"color":"Black","size":"XL","stock":10},{"color":"Black","size":"XXL","stock":10},{"color":"White","size":"S","stock":10},{"color":"White","size":"M","stock":10},{"color":"White","size":"L","stock":10},{"color":"White","size":"XL","stock":10},{"color":"White","size":"XXL","stock":10}]$q$::jsonb, $q$PUBLISHED$q$),
  ($q$prod-014$q$, $q$INDIAN CRAFT ATLAS TEE$q$, $q$indian-craft-atlas-tee$q$, $q$A map of India drawn in its crafts. Kalamkari, Warli, Madhubani, Pattachitra, Phad, Gond, Cheriyal, Pichwai and Ikat come together around one elephant. Oversized 240 GSM French Terry cotton, bio + silicone washed, DTF back print.$q$, $q$People, patterns, places, purpose. India lives in its crafts, and every region adds a pattern of its own. This design puts a dozen of them on one elephant, with the names listed alongside so you know what you are wearing.$q$, $q$Kalamkari from Andhra Pradesh, Warli from Maharashtra, Madhubani from Bihar, Pattachitra from Odisha, Phad from Rajasthan, Gond from Madhya Pradesh, Cheriyal from Telangana, Pichwai from Nathdwara, Ikat from Odisha and Telangana, and more.$q$, 699, 999, NULL, $q$heritage$q$, ARRAY[$q$oversized$q$, $q$heritage$q$, $q$crafts$q$, $q$kalamkari$q$, $q$madhubani$q$, $q$warli$q$, $q$240gsm$q$]::TEXT[], $q$240 GSM FRENCH TERRY // BIO + SILICONE WASH$q$, 240, $q$Oversized Drop-Shoulder$q$, $q$240 GSM French Terry Cotton, Bio + Silicone Washed$q$, $q$BRVD-ICA-02$q$, true, true, false, $q$DESIGN 02$q$, $q$NEW DROP$q$, $q${"front":"/images/products/craft-atlas/back-print.webp?v=2","closeup":"/images/products/craft-atlas/closeup.webp","lifestyle":"/images/lookbook/lb-look-02.webp"}$q$::jsonb, $q$[{"color":"Black","size":"S","stock":10},{"color":"Black","size":"M","stock":10},{"color":"Black","size":"L","stock":10},{"color":"Black","size":"XL","stock":10},{"color":"Black","size":"XXL","stock":10},{"color":"White","size":"S","stock":10},{"color":"White","size":"M","stock":10},{"color":"White","size":"L","stock":10},{"color":"White","size":"XL","stock":10},{"color":"White","size":"XXL","stock":10},{"color":"Red","size":"S","stock":10},{"color":"Red","size":"M","stock":10},{"color":"Red","size":"L","stock":10},{"color":"Red","size":"XL","stock":10},{"color":"Red","size":"XXL","stock":10},{"color":"Royal Blue","size":"S","stock":10},{"color":"Royal Blue","size":"M","stock":10},{"color":"Royal Blue","size":"L","stock":10},{"color":"Royal Blue","size":"XL","stock":10},{"color":"Royal Blue","size":"XXL","stock":10}]$q$::jsonb, $q$PUBLISHED$q$),
  ($q$prod-013$q$, $q$BHARAT SPIRIT TEE$q$, $q$bharat-spirit-tee$q$, $q$The peacock, the tiger, the lotus and the elephant, four symbols of India drawn together as one story. Oversized 240 GSM French Terry cotton, bio + silicone washed, with a large DTF back print and the Bi mark on the chest.$q$, $q$Four symbols every Indian grows up with, drawn as one living composition. Built around the idea that pride in where you come from can be worn every day, not saved for special occasions.$q$, $q$Peacock, the national bird, for grace. Tiger, the national animal, for courage. Lotus, the national flower, for rising clean from the mud. Elephant, the national heritage animal, for memory and strength.$q$, 699, 999, NULL, $q$heritage$q$, ARRAY[$q$oversized$q$, $q$heritage$q$, $q$peacock$q$, $q$tiger$q$, $q$lotus$q$, $q$elephant$q$, $q$240gsm$q$]::TEXT[], $q$240 GSM FRENCH TERRY // BIO + SILICONE WASH$q$, 240, $q$Oversized Drop-Shoulder$q$, $q$240 GSM French Terry Cotton, Bio + Silicone Washed$q$, $q$BRVD-BHS-01$q$, true, true, false, $q$DESIGN 01$q$, $q$NEW DROP$q$, $q${"front":"/images/products/bharat-spirit/back-print.webp","back":"/images/products/bharat-spirit/front.webp","closeup":"/images/products/bharat-spirit/closeup.webp","lifestyle":"/images/products/bharat-spirit/worn-studio.webp?v=2","lifestyle2":"/images/products/bharat-spirit/worn-temple.webp?v=3"}$q$::jsonb, $q$[{"color":"Black","size":"S","stock":10},{"color":"Black","size":"M","stock":10},{"color":"Black","size":"L","stock":10},{"color":"Black","size":"XL","stock":10},{"color":"Black","size":"XXL","stock":10},{"color":"White","size":"S","stock":10},{"color":"White","size":"M","stock":10},{"color":"White","size":"L","stock":10},{"color":"White","size":"XL","stock":10},{"color":"White","size":"XXL","stock":10},{"color":"Red","size":"S","stock":10},{"color":"Red","size":"M","stock":10},{"color":"Red","size":"L","stock":10},{"color":"Red","size":"XL","stock":10},{"color":"Red","size":"XXL","stock":10},{"color":"Roya